{
  "survey": {
    "type": "survey",
    "id": "survey_service_satisfaction_campaign",
    "title": "<h1>服务满意度回访</h1>",
    "description": "<p>你好，这是一份面向真实服务场景的满意度回访问卷示例。我们会根据你的反馈，判断是进入普通感谢结束页，还是进入更偏 <strong>安抚 + 后续跟进</strong> 的结束页。</p>",
    "attribute": {
      "onePageOneQuestion": true,
      "allowBack": true,
      "media": []
    }
  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_service_channel",
      "title": "<h2>你本次体验的是哪类服务？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>用于帮助我们区分不同服务链路的体验差异。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_channel_online",
          "title": "<p>线上咨询 / 在线客服</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_channel_store",
          "title": "<p>到店服务 / 线下接待</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_channel_delivery",
          "title": "<p>上门 / 配送 / 履约相关服务</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_overall_satisfaction",
      "title": "<h2>你对本次服务整体满意吗？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>这是本次回访里最核心的一题。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_satisfied",
          "title": "<p>满意</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_unsatisfied",
          "title": "<p>不满意</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "score",
      "id": "question_service_score",
      "title": "<h2>请你为以下维度打分</h2>",
      "description": "<p>1 分最低，5 分最高。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_score_speed",
          "title": "<p>响应速度</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "scope": [1, 5],
            "step": 1,
            "scoreDesc": {
              "1": "很差",
              "2": "较差",
              "3": "一般",
              "4": "满意",
              "5": "非常满意"
            },
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_score_clarity",
          "title": "<p>沟通清晰度</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "scope": [1, 5],
            "step": 1,
            "scoreDesc": {
              "1": "很差",
              "2": "较差",
              "3": "一般",
              "4": "满意",
              "5": "非常满意"
            },
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_score_result",
          "title": "<p>问题解决结果</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "scope": [1, 5],
            "step": 1,
            "scoreDesc": {
              "1": "很差",
              "2": "较差",
              "3": "一般",
              "4": "满意",
              "5": "非常满意"
            },
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "input",
      "id": "question_service_highlight",
      "title": "<h2>如果你满意，欢迎补充最认可我们的哪一点</h2>",
      "description": "<p>这会帮助我们知道最应该继续保持的服务优势。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_highlight_text",
          "title": "<p>你最认可的服务亮点</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "例如：响应很快、态度很好、处理很专业",
            "maxLength": 200
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "question_unsatisfied_reason",
      "title": "<h2>如果不满意，主要原因是什么？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>可多选，我们会优先定位影响最大的问题。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_reason_speed",
          "title": "<p>响应速度慢</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_reason_attitude",
          "title": "<p>服务态度一般</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_reason_solution",
          "title": "<p>问题没有真正解决</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_reason_expectation",
          "title": "<p>结果与预期差距较大</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_reason_other",
          "title": "<p>其他，请说明</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          },
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "input",
              "id": "child_reason_other_text",
              "title": "<p>补充说明</p>",
              "attribute": {
                "required": true,
                "dataType": "text",
                "placeholder": "请补充你的真实感受",
                "maxLength": 200
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_followup_permission",
      "title": "<h2>如果我们安排专人跟进，你愿意接受回访吗？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>仅用于处理本次反馈，不会用于营销打扰。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_followup_yes",
          "title": "<p>愿意，请联系我</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_followup_no",
          "title": "<p>暂时不用联系</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "input",
      "id": "question_contact_detail",
      "title": "<h2>请留下你的联系方式</h2>",
      "description": "<p>仅在你同意回访时用于后续处理。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_contact_name",
          "title": "<p>姓名</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入你的姓名",
            "maxLength": 40
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_contact_phone",
          "title": "<p>手机号</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "tel",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入手机号，如 13800000000",
            "maxLength": 20
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "finish": [
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_happy_path",
      "title": "<h2>感谢你的认可</h2>",
      "description": "<p>你的正向反馈会帮助我们继续稳定输出更好的服务体验，也欢迎你未来继续提出建议。</p>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_care_path",
      "title": "<h2>感谢你的坦诚反馈</h2>",
      "description": "<p>很抱歉这次体验没有达到预期。我们会认真处理你的意见，并持续优化服务流程。</p>",
      "media": []
    }
  ],
  "logic": [
    {
      "id": "logic_show_highlight_for_satisfied",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_satisfaction",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_satisfied"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_service_highlight"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_reason_for_unsatisfied",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_satisfaction",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_unsatisfied"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_unsatisfied_reason"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_followup_for_unsatisfied",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_overall_satisfaction",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_unsatisfied"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_followup_permission"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_satisfied_end_to_happy_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_service_highlight",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_happy_path"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_contact_detail_when_followup_yes",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_followup_permission",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_followup_yes"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_contact_detail"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_followup_no_to_care_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_followup_permission",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_followup_no"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_care_path"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_contact_detail_to_care_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_contact_detail",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_care_path"
      }
    }
  ]
}
